## Changing the .jidl

The Python types next to `app/python/{{name}}.py` were generated from `{{idl_main}}` when this project was made.
When you change the `.jidl`, generate them again (the `juiz_std` types come with pyjuiz, so they are not generated):

```sh
juiz idl -g python --extern juiz_std -o app/python {{idl_main}}
```

Then change the functions in `app/python/{{name}}.py` and `app/app.conf` to match
(`juiz idl -g python-skeleton -o <dir> {{idl_main}}` writes the functions of all the declarations again, to copy from).

## Versions

The package version is `0.1.0` in both `pyproject.toml` and `app/juizapp.yaml`. When you release a new version, change both.
